# Forge's route search orders the quests of this guide and its guide writer writes the steps.
# Fixes go into data/route-fixes.json, data/guide-fixes.json or forever-db/corrections, never
# into this file.
# Hand-cut 2026-11-07 (Alliance 12-20 zone order): Darkshore's southern and last loops, after the
# Eastern Kingdoms loop (03-loch-modan), which ends on the boat from Stormwind (or the Hearthstone,
# still bound in Auberdine from the first visit). The route notes for both Darkshore visits are in
# 03-darkshore.
#
# Flow: Auberdine (the quests whose work is on these loops) -> Onu at the Grove -> the Master's
# Glaive, Remtravel's dig, Murkdeep's beach -> the Grove -> Auberdine ->
# the naga and the Ruins of Mathystra -> back south (Auberdine, the Grove) -> Volcor -> Auberdine
# (Druids: Cat Form), then Kerlonian's escort south through Darkshore (06-ashenvale).

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Auberdine

step Auberdine
  zone Darkshore
  tip From the dock (or the inn, if you used your Hearthstone), up to the north end of the village first (Thundris Windweaver, Alanndarian Nightsong by the moonwell, Archaeologist Hollee), then down the main street: the WANTED poster outside the inn, Terenthis at its east end, where the road leaves south. Sentinel Selarin (Trek to Ashenvale) is beside Terenthis only for a few minutes at a time: she comes shortly after someone hands in Volcor's escort and leaves again about 5 minutes later. If she isn't there, don't wait: the guide offers her quest again when you hand in Volcor's escort to Terenthis yourself. Changing layer can also find her.
  turnin 97926 optional only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Thundris Windweaver, north end of the village: Baros Alexston's reply
  accept 6123 only NightElf,Skyborne,Druid             -- Alanndarian Nightsong
  vendor nearest optional
  accept 4740                                 -- The WANTED poster
  accept 986 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Terenthis
  accept 990 optional                         -- Sentinel Selarin, beside Terenthis if she is there: for Raene Wolfrunner in Astranaar, in the next guide
  accept 990 optional only Druid -- Sentinel Selarin, once she comes: Trek to Ashenvale, for Raene Wolfrunner in Astranaar on your next Ashenvale visit

step Lunar Fungus and Earthroot
  only NightElf,Skyborne,Druid
  tip On the way south to the Grove: the Lunar Fungal Blooms grow in the moonkin caves in the hills just east of Auberdine, a short way off the road; the moonkin there are irritable. Earthroot needs Herbalism: herbalists pick it all over Darkshore, anyone else brings it from Stormwind (Maria Lumere) or the Auction House.
  collect 2449 x5 quest 6123.1 only NightElf,Skyborne -- Earthroot
  collect 15851 x12 quest 6123.2 only NightElf,Skyborne -- Lunar Fungus

