# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Fourth loop: the south

step The Grove of the Ancients
  tip Grizzled Thistle Bears roam the hills around the Grove; Buzzbox 525 stands west of it among them.
  collect 5414 quest 1003 @51.5,38.3 map 1439 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Grizzled Scalps; below ground
  turnin 1003 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Buzzbox 525

step The Master's Glaive
  tip Moonstalker Sires prowl the woods around the glaive. The Twilight Tome sits at the bottom of the crater; Therylune stands on its north side. For Onu's quest, use the Phial of Scrying at the bottom of the crater: it makes the Scrying Bowl, and you hand the quest in to the bowl.
  collect 5386 quest 986 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Fine Moonstalker Pelts
  accept 968 optional only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Only if a Disciple or Thug dropped Book: The Powers Below: right-click it
  complete 944
  turnin 944                                  -- The Scrying Bowl
  accept 949
  turnin 949                                  -- The Twilight Tome
  accept 98042 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- The Twilight Tome, once it has The Twilight Camp
  collect 279279 quest 98042 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Peerless Eye: Twilight Disciples and Thugs
  accept 945 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Therylune

step The Master's Glaive
  when onquest 945
  complete 945 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Escort her out of the glaive; Therysil takes the turn-in in Ashenvale

step Murkdeep's beach
  tip Murkdeep camps on the beach west of the glaive: kill the murlocs at the camp fire; he comes in the third wave with his hound. Four beached remains lie on the beaches west and south-west of Remtravel's Excavation: take them on the way north to his camp.
  accept 4733 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Beached Sea Creature
  accept 4732 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Beached Sea Turtle
  accept 4731 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Beached Sea Turtle
  accept 4730 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Beached Sea Creature
