step Dendrite Starblaze
  only Druid
  zone Moonglade
  tip Cast Teleport: Moonglade. Dendrite Starblaze stands upstairs in his building in Nighthaven: go up inside, the arrow cannot tell the floors apart. No Moonglade flight path yet? Learn it from Sindrayl, south of the lake: the flight master in Nighthaven flies only Druids, from her gossip, and has none to learn.
  turnin 98393 only NightElf,Skyborne -- Dendrite Starblaze
